This application bundles the aria2 executable (https://aria2.github.io/),
which is licensed under the GNU General Public License v2. Deyon's own
source code (everything in this repository) is distributed under the MIT
license above; it invokes the unmodified aria2c binary as a separate
subprocess over its JSON-RPC interface and does not link against it. aria2's
source code is available at https://github.com/aria2/aria2 and its license
text at https://github.com/aria2/aria2/blob/master/COPYING.
